{"id":"lanko-173-floor-leveller","rules":[{"id":"lanko-173-floor-leveller:suitability:87cda950","type":"suitability","polarity":"yes","conditional":true,"tags":{"substrate":["waterproofing_membrane"],"environment":["wet_area"]},"mentions":[],"text":"When used externally or in wet areas ensure suitable waterproof covering is applied, ie waterproofing membrane and tile finish.","heading":"DESCRIPTION","source":{"doc_type":"PDS","url":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/7/lanko-173-floor-leveller.pdf","page":1,"page_end":1,"doc_version":"August 2025, Version 01.01","section":"DESCRIPTION","web_url":"https://aus.sika.com/en/construction/flooring/cement-levellingsystems/lanko-173-floor-leveller.html"}},{"id":"lanko-173-floor-leveller:suitability:07e2e572","type":"suitability","polarity":"yes","conditional":true,"tags":{"substrate":["self_levelling_underlayment"]},"mentions":[],"text":"LANKO® 173 Floor Leveller can be extended for deep applications between 10-100mm with a suitable aggregate or pea gravel 3-8mm in size.","heading":"DESCRIPTION","source":{"doc_type":"PDS","url":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/7/lanko-173-floor-leveller.pdf","page":1,"page_end":1,"doc_version":"August 2025, Version 01.01","section":"DESCRIPTION","web_url":"https://aus.sika.com/en/construction/flooring/cement-levellingsystems/lanko-173-floor-leveller.html"}},{"id":"lanko-173-floor-leveller:suitability:a1c6fcbe","type":"suitability","polarity":"yes","conditional":false,"tags":{"substrate":["concrete","self_levelling_underlayment"]},"mentions":[],"text":"LANKO® 173 Floor Leveller is ideal for repairing small holes, uneven concrete","heading":"DESCRIPTION","source":{"doc_type":"PDS","url":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/7/lanko-173-floor-leveller.pdf","page":1,"page_end":1,"doc_version":"August 2025, Version 01.01","section":"DESCRIPTION","web_url":"https://aus.sika.com/en/construction/flooring/cement-levellingsystems/lanko-173-floor-leveller.html"}},{"id":"lanko-173-floor-leveller:suitability:3b316f83","type":"suitability","polarity":"yes","conditional":false,"tags":{"substrate":["self_levelling_underlayment"],"environment":["internal"]},"mentions":[],"text":"LANKO® 173 Floor Leveller is suitable for internal and externally","heading":"USES","source":{"doc_type":"PDS","url":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/7/lanko-173-floor-leveller.pdf","page":1,"page_end":1,"doc_version":"August 2025, Version 01.01","section":"USES","web_url":"https://aus.sika.com/en/construction/flooring/cement-levellingsystems/lanko-173-floor-leveller.html"}},{"id":"lanko-173-floor-leveller:suitability:6c4a3b5b","type":"suitability","polarity":"yes","conditional":true,"tags":{"environment":["floor"]},"mentions":[],"text":"It is compatible with commonly used adhesives and normally can receive floor coverings within hours of installation, refer wait time prior to application of floor coverings.","heading":"USES","source":{"doc_type":"PDS","url":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/7/lanko-173-floor-leveller.pdf","page":1,"page_end":1,"doc_version":"August 2025, Version 01.01","section":"USES","web_url":"https://aus.sika.com/en/construction/flooring/cement-levellingsystems/lanko-173-floor-leveller.html"}},{"id":"lanko-173-floor-leveller:suitability:1244a992","type":"suitability","polarity":"no","conditional":false,"tags":{"substrate":["self_levelling_underlayment"]},"mentions":[],"text":"LANKO® 173 Floor Leveller is not suitable for use as a wearing surface or to remain exposed to traffic","heading":"USES","source":{"doc_type":"PDS","url":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/7/lanko-173-floor-leveller.pdf","page":1,"page_end":1,"doc_version":"August 2025, Version 01.01","section":"USES","web_url":"https://aus.sika.com/en/construction/flooring/cement-levellingsystems/lanko-173-floor-leveller.html"}},{"id":"lanko-173-floor-leveller:suitability:34dbaf2f","type":"suitability","polarity":"yes","conditional":true,"tags":{"environment":["floor"]},"mentions":[],"text":"use dry and cured cover with a suitable floor covering.","heading":"USES","source":{"doc_type":"PDS","url":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/7/lanko-173-floor-leveller.pdf","page":1,"page_end":1,"doc_version":"August 2025, Version 01.01","section":"USES","web_url":"https://aus.sika.com/en/construction/flooring/cement-levellingsystems/lanko-173-floor-leveller.html"}},{"id":"lanko-173-floor-leveller:suitability:1f79b6d0","type":"suitability","polarity":"yes","conditional":false,"tags":{"substrate":["concrete"]},"mentions":[],"text":"Ideal for repairing small holes, and uneven concrete surfaces","heading":"CHARACTERISTICS / ADVANTAGES","source":{"doc_type":"PDS","url":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/7/lanko-173-floor-leveller.pdf","page":1,"page_end":1,"doc_version":"August 2025, Version 01.01","section":"CHARACTERISTICS / ADVANTAGES","web_url":"https://aus.sika.com/en/construction/flooring/cement-levellingsystems/lanko-173-floor-leveller.html"}},{"id":"lanko-173-floor-leveller:suitability:53329fab","type":"suitability","polarity":"no","conditional":false,"tags":{"substrate":["self_levelling_underlayment"],"environment":["freeze_thaw"]},"mentions":[],"text":"Do not apply LANKO® 173 Floor Leveller over frozen or frost filled surfaces","heading":"IMPORTANT CONSIDERATIONS","source":{"doc_type":"PDS","url":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/7/lanko-173-floor-leveller.pdf","page":2,"page_end":2,"doc_version":"August 2025, Version 01.01","section":"IMPORTANT CONSIDERATIONS","web_url":"https://aus.sika.com/en/construction/flooring/cement-levellingsystems/lanko-173-floor-leveller.html"}},{"id":"lanko-173-floor-leveller:suitability:a3387bf7","type":"suitability","polarity":"no","conditional":true,"tags":{"substrate":["self_levelling_underlayment"]},"mentions":[],"text":"Do not mix or apply LANKO® 173 Floor Leveller when temperatures are below 5°C or above 35°C. Also, do not apply if temperatures are expected to reach these le